    "text": "KOLO TV Reno\nwebsite\nSparks\nAJR kicks off Somewhere in the Sky tour at the Nugget Event Center\nBy Katey RoshetkoHana Altenburg,\n10 hours agoRENO, Nev. (KOLO) - Get ready for an unforgettable night of bold hooks, anthemic beats, and next-level energy as AJR hits the stage at the Nugget Event Center this July! The multi-platinum indie pop trio behind hits like “Bang!”, “Weak,” and “World’s Smallest Violin” brings their electrifying live show to Sparks for one night only.",
